        "execSummary":  "Microsoft is actively lowering the barrier to AI agent creation through Copilot, targeting business users — not just developers — as the next wave of agent builders. For enterprise leaders, this signals that agent proliferation inside organizations will accelerate faster than IT governance frameworks can keep pace. The no-code framing is a double-edged sword: it democratizes automation but increases the risk of ungoverned, shadow-IT agents operating on live business data. Establish agent governance policies and a centralized registry before this wave hits your organization.",
