        "execSummary":  "Kier Group\u0027s deployment illustrates how a traditional, risk-averse industry can achieve meaningful AI adoption by pairing strong change management with a clear safety-first use case. The prompt-a-thon model — structured, hands-on executive training — is a replicable playbook for organizations struggling with top-down AI adoption resistance. For customer-support and operations leaders, the safety data analysis use case is directly analogous to quality monitoring and agent-assist in support environments. The Human at the Helm governance stance is the right liability posture for any regulated or high-stakes deployment.",
