        "execSummary":  "Google\u0027s Gemini Live update signals the maturation of AI assistants from reactive query tools into proactive, voice-driven productivity agents embedded in enterprise workflows. For customer-support leaders, the hands-free email management and multi-step task automation features preview the interaction paradigm that will define next-generation agent-assist and supervisor tools. The Personal Intelligence memory layer raises enterprise data privacy questions — particularly around what conversational context is retained, where, and for how long. Organizations evaluating Gemini for enterprise productivity should audit data retention policies before broad deployment.",
