        "execSummary":  "Enterprise AI leaders face a dual-use dilemma: the same frontier models that empower defenders also expand adversarial attack surfaces. AWS\u0027s approach to releasing Claude Fable 5 illustrates how hyperscalers are embedding safety tiers — automated guardrails, usage monitoring, and industry coordination — directly into model access. For procurement and governance teams, this signals that model-release safety rigor is becoming a vendor differentiator and a due-diligence criterion. Enterprises should evaluate cloud AI vendors not just on model capability benchmarks but on their published release safety methodology.",
