        "summary":  "A Princeton-led study found that AI agents excel at engineering tasks but lack the creativity and judgment needed for open-ended AI research, limiting recursive self-improvement potential. Current systems struggle with novel thinking and cannot effectively backtrack from failing approaches, suggesting that superintelligence timelines may be significantly more optimistic than evidence supports.",
